flowchart TD
    A["Raw count matrix from 6 samples<br/>WT / Dac × E9.5 / E10.5 / E11.5"]
    A --> B["DISTILL hard cell QC<br/>200 ≤ detected genes ≤ 8000<br/>500 ≤ UMIs ≤ 50000"]
    B --> C{"Mitochondrial percentage"}
    C -->|"≤ 12.5%"| D["Per-sample ASTRID<br/>Clustering and initial annotation"]
    C -->|"> 12.5%"| E["Retain high-mitochondrial cells<br/>Await kNN annotation"]
    D --> F["Manual cluster review<br/>Relabel by sample and cluster prefix"]
    F --> G["Exclude Low quality, manually Unannotated,<br/>and ASTRID unassigned cells"]
    G --> H["Reference cells<br/>Valid manual annotation<br/>Originally annotated by the authors"]
    G --> I["Query cells<br/>Remaining author-unannotated cells"]
    E --> I
    H --> J["Per-sample kNN label transfer<br/>Depth normalization → log1p → PCA<br/>30 components; k = 10"]
    I --> J
    J --> K["Entropy filtering of query cells only<br/>Keep entropy < 0.3"]
    H --> L["Final retained cells<br/>aer_post_entropy.h5ad"]
    K --> L

    L --> M["BioLUCID batch-effect diagnostics<br/>Global and per-sample results → manual review"]
    M --> N["TIDYI gene preparation<br/>replay3 local cached mapping"]
    N --> O["Train and apply mouse TIDYI<br/>Predict per-cell proliferation/death scores"]
    O --> P["Sample × cell-type rates<br/>Report only groups with > 50 cells"]
    P --> Q["Method 3: growth-rate change decomposition<br/>Developmental and Dac–WT contrasts<br/>Relative death and proliferation contributions"]
    Q --> R["Contribution tables, heatmaps,<br/>and distributions"]
    P --> S["Proliferation/death rate plots"]
    L --> T["Cell-type composition per sample"]

